sec.p:
Termination is mandatory when any of the following conditions are met: $R
f a l l s t o o r b e l o w d i a g n o s t i c l a t e n c y v i o l a t e s 1 ;
\tau_L\gamma_{nl}<0.1$; oscillatory behavior persists in the marginal band beyond the recovery window; or mode amplitude exceeds the pre-defined safety envelope. The termination sequence shuts down field drivers, disables energy input, freezes diagnostics at the point of termination, and records a complete parameter log. Once in the runaway state, recovery is not assumed.

td.p:
Same governance architecture as microgravity nonlinear plasma platform baseline; 
